  "title": "· New Bags · Louis Vuitton Unveils Men's Monogram Eclipse Collection with Khaki Green Leather Trim",
  "original_title": "新包 | Louis Vuitton 上架男士 Monogram Eclipse 系列新品：卡其绿色皮革饰边",
  "excerpt": "Louis Vuitton's new Monogram Eclipse men's bags blend black-gray canvas with khaki leather for a rugged military look.",
