      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Messenger Bags ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The**Courrier Messenger**is a new silhouette this season, inspired by Japanese street style from the early 2000s. It features a vintage messenger profile with refined leather trim, a zip outer pocket, and a flap pocket for ample storage. Khaki green leather accents and logo jacquard strap lend a utilitarian vibe. The adjustable side buckle allows for shoulder or crossbody wear, while the front D-ring invites personalization with charms.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
