      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The**Trio Messenger**offers a versatile 3-in-1 construction: the front zip pouch and coin pouch on the strap are detachable, allowing multiple styling options. Crafted from Monogram Eclipse canvas with khaki green leather piping, tags, and jacquard strap, it's a practical yet understated choice.",
