      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Keepall line is available in four sizes: 25, 35, 45, and 55. The black-gray Monogram Eclipse canvas provides a subdued backdrop, while khaki green leather trim and tags add highlights. The LOUIS VUITTON logo jacquard strap injects a streetwear edge. Whether for daily outings, commuting, travel, or gym sessions, these bags are wardrobe staples.",
